<p><strong><img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/indiacitytrip.com/code/images/Jaipur/Nov0909_JaipurCityBusStand.jpg" style="width:200px;height:150px;float:right" alt =""/></strong>Jaipur bus stand is located in center part of Jaipur and  also 1 KM away from Jaipur railway station and 14 KM from Jaipur Airport .


The general &amp; luxury bus services are run by Rajasthan State Road Transportation Corp. , these buses run on regular interval depending upon the bus route. </p>
